	(text "Current sense: R_shunt = 50 mOhm,   DRV8323 CSA gain = 10 V/V,   VREF = 3.3 V\n\n\n\nMotor BGM5208-75T, 4S: I_max = (16.8 V / sqrt(3)) / 7.5 Ohm ≈ 1.3 A peak\n\nV_SO = VREF/2 + I x R_shunt x G = 1.65 V + I x 0.05 Ohm x 10\n\nFull scale = 1.65 V / (G x R_shunt) = 1.65 V / (10 x 0.05 Ohm) = ±3.3 A (linear ≈ ±2.8 A)\n\nP_shunt = I² x R_shunt = (1.3 A)² x 0.05 Ohm ≈ 85 mW"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
